1
00:00:39,828 --> 00:00:45,728
=My Loong=

2
00:00:46,004 --> 00:00:48,480
=Episode 14=

3
00:01:18,931 --> 00:01:19,616
(Greed)

4
00:01:20,519 --> 00:01:21,200
I

5
00:01:21,760 --> 00:01:25,079
have never demanded
any sacrifice from you mortals.

6
00:01:26,400 --> 00:01:27,439
Are you...

7
00:01:27,680 --> 00:01:28,239
He's a loong!

8
00:01:28,560 --> 00:01:29,200
He's Loong Lord!

9
00:01:29,480 --> 00:01:30,680
Using my name

10
00:01:31,519 --> 00:01:33,719
to commit extortion and murder

11
00:01:35,519 --> 00:01:36,359
warrants death.

12
00:01:38,319 --> 00:01:40,120
I shall spare your life today.

13
00:01:40,519 --> 00:01:43,480
No one shall use my name

14
00:01:43,480 --> 00:01:45,719
to commit such atrocities.

15
00:01:47,239 --> 00:01:48,359
Anyone who defies this

16
00:01:50,319 --> 00:01:51,879
shall face divine retribution

17
00:01:51,879 --> 00:01:53,680
and have their soul shattered!

18
00:02:06,959 --> 00:02:07,480
My Lord!

19
00:02:08,560 --> 00:02:09,120
My Lord,

20
00:02:09,520 --> 00:02:10,479
for Ladies Yue's case,

21
00:02:10,719 --> 00:02:12,159
the censor has come in person!

22
00:02:12,319 --> 00:02:12,960
And he...

23
00:02:13,439 --> 00:02:15,599
I can't go right now.

24
00:02:17,879 --> 00:02:19,159
Isn't Zhang Fan "sick"?

25
00:02:19,159 --> 00:02:20,759
How can he not even handle this?

26
00:02:21,039 --> 00:02:22,879
H-He says he has recovered.

27
00:02:23,439 --> 00:02:25,240
He asks you two
to attend court immediately,

28
00:02:25,639 --> 00:02:26,960
lest the censor take offense.

29
00:02:28,639 --> 00:02:29,360
Zhang Fan,

30
00:02:30,400 --> 00:02:31,919
you've certainly kept me waiting.

31
00:02:33,199 --> 00:02:34,159
Imperial Censor.

32
00:02:44,479 --> 00:02:45,439
He isn't showing?

33
00:02:46,080 --> 00:02:47,159
Is he really sick?

34
00:02:47,439 --> 00:02:48,240
Indeed.

35
00:02:56,148 --> 00:02:56,928
Who is she?

36
00:02:56,928 --> 00:02:57,440
Look.

37
00:03:08,960 --> 00:03:09,879
Here they come.

38
00:03:09,879 --> 00:03:11,000
Now the real show starts.

39
00:03:12,787 --> 00:03:13,748
(Daizhou Yamen)

40
00:03:15,360 --> 00:03:16,000
Court begins!

41
00:03:17,199 --> 00:03:18,800
Summon the plaintiffs, Yue Wangshu

42
00:03:19,240 --> 00:03:20,120
and Yue Xingyao,

43
00:03:20,120 --> 00:03:22,360
and the defendants,
Madam Jiang and Lady Yue.

44
00:03:22,800 --> 00:03:25,280
All parties, enter the court!

45
00:03:34,452 --> 00:03:37,344
(Daizhou Yamen)

46
00:04:05,120 --> 00:04:06,000
Lord Zhang,

47
00:04:07,039 --> 00:04:09,199
since the Imperial Censor
wishes to observe,

48
00:04:09,719 --> 00:04:11,120
why doesn't he show himself?

49
00:04:13,639 --> 00:04:14,840
Perhaps he doesn't wish

50
00:04:15,439 --> 00:04:16,480
to influence my judgment.

51
00:04:17,800 --> 00:04:18,560
Madam Jiang,

52
00:04:19,240 --> 00:04:21,000
are you questioning my authority?

53
00:04:22,439 --> 00:04:23,560
I wouldn't dare.

54
00:04:24,360 --> 00:04:25,120
Then let us begin.

55
00:04:25,680 --> 00:04:26,519
Yue Wangshu,

56
00:04:27,480 --> 00:04:29,240
you accuse the General's Manor.

57
00:04:29,240 --> 00:04:30,600
This skips due process.

58
00:04:30,959 --> 00:04:33,720
Regardless of the verdict,
you will face punishment.

59
00:04:34,240 --> 00:04:35,120
Do you know that?

60
00:04:35,120 --> 00:04:36,439
I do not fear punishment.

61
00:04:37,079 --> 00:04:38,040
I only fear

62
00:04:38,759 --> 00:04:39,959
that before justice is served,

63
00:04:40,279 --> 00:04:41,639
the Yue elder branch will kill us.

64
00:04:43,360 --> 00:04:44,360
By then,

65
00:04:45,040 --> 00:04:46,519
the dead will tell no tales.

66
00:04:46,639 --> 00:04:47,399
Absurd!

67
00:04:48,399 --> 00:04:49,959
Our esteemed General's Manor

68
00:04:50,439 --> 00:04:52,079
would never disregard the law

69
00:04:52,480 --> 00:04:54,079
or treat human life like dirt.

70
00:04:54,879 --> 00:04:56,079
With Madam Jiang's word,

71
00:04:56,600 --> 00:04:57,800
I am relieved.

72
00:05:00,160 --> 00:05:01,240
Would the General's Manor

73
00:05:01,759 --> 00:05:02,720
really do such a thing?

74
00:05:04,079 --> 00:05:04,600
Silence!

75
00:05:05,480 --> 00:05:06,480
What are your grievances?

76
00:05:07,639 --> 00:05:08,519
Speak them plainly.

77
00:05:08,680 --> 00:05:09,399
This court

78
00:05:10,519 --> 00:05:11,639
will see justice done.

79
00:05:13,959 --> 00:05:14,839
My first accusation

80
00:05:15,120 --> 00:05:16,639
is against the elder branch's
Jiang Liuying.

81
00:05:17,040 --> 00:05:18,199
She is venomous and cruel.

82
00:05:18,560 --> 00:05:20,120
To seize my parents' estate,

83
00:05:20,879 --> 00:05:22,600
she murdered
my father's old subordinates.

84
00:05:22,879 --> 00:05:24,120
You slanderous liar!

85
00:05:25,800 --> 00:05:27,240
Three days after my parents died,

86
00:05:27,800 --> 00:05:29,399
a veteran officer of my father

87
00:05:29,639 --> 00:05:31,680
had his entire household
slaughtered by bandits.

88
00:05:31,920 --> 00:05:32,600
That same year,

89
00:05:32,839 --> 00:05:34,439
Li, my father's trusted guard,

90
00:05:35,199 --> 00:05:37,319
suddenly fell off a cliff to his death.

91
00:05:37,800 --> 00:05:38,600
And Wang Chu,

92
00:05:39,000 --> 00:05:39,552
Li Ling,

93
00:05:40,000 --> 00:05:40,759
and Zhang Jian.

94
00:05:41,279 --> 00:05:42,920
Those were merely coincidences.

95
00:05:43,319 --> 00:05:45,160
What do you take this court for?

96
00:05:45,639 --> 00:05:46,399
Where's your proof?

97
00:05:49,024 --> 00:05:50,480
(General's Manor Armament Ledgers)
When my father was alive,

98
00:05:50,920 --> 00:05:52,199
these armament ledgers

99
00:05:52,199 --> 00:05:53,519
between the manor and the generals

100
00:05:53,800 --> 00:05:55,199
were kept by Li himself.

101
00:05:59,507 --> 00:06:00,832
(General's Manor Armament Ledgers)

102
00:06:01,519 --> 00:06:02,560
In one entry,

103
00:06:03,279 --> 00:06:05,319
my father approved
three thousand taels of silver

104
00:06:05,639 --> 00:06:07,399
for Li to deliver to the southern camp

105
00:06:07,680 --> 00:06:09,120
to support wounded veterans.

106
00:06:10,040 --> 00:06:10,600
Strangely,

107
00:06:11,399 --> 00:06:12,959
a day after the silver left the capital,

108
00:06:13,800 --> 00:06:15,600
Li fell off the cliff.

109
00:06:16,560 --> 00:06:17,480
And that very same day,

110
00:06:18,000 --> 00:06:20,519
a pawnshop owned by Madam Jiang's
maiden family, the Jiangs,

111
00:06:20,920 --> 00:06:22,920
received a dead pawn
worth three thousand taels.

112
00:06:22,920 --> 00:06:24,120
Nonsense!

113
00:06:24,879 --> 00:06:26,920
Where did you get these forged accounts?

114
00:06:27,680 --> 00:06:29,360
(Ticket: 3,000 Taels Payable on Demand)
Is this pawn ticket fake as well?

115
00:06:31,168 --> 00:06:31,744
A pawn ticket?

116
00:06:31,744 --> 00:06:32,288
Is it real?

117
00:06:32,640 --> 00:06:33,160
Right.

118
00:06:33,160 --> 00:06:34,439
The manager of the pawnshop

119
00:06:34,720 --> 00:06:36,519
is Madam Jiang's distant cousin.

120
00:06:36,800 --> 00:06:37,480
(Ticket: 3,000 Taels Payable on Demand)
My lord,

121
00:06:38,680 --> 00:06:40,879
this can hardly be another coincidence.

122
00:06:41,040 --> 00:06:42,199
Right. No way.

123
00:06:42,199 --> 00:06:43,560
- It can't be fake.
- It's real.

124
00:06:43,560 --> 00:06:44,416
- Exactly.
- Indeed.

125
00:06:56,759 --> 00:06:58,639
This matter is of great consequence.

126
00:06:58,959 --> 00:07:00,439
This court needs days to investigate.

127
00:07:00,439 --> 00:07:01,879
Court is adjourned for today.

128
00:07:03,319 --> 00:07:04,160
Wait, My Lord.

129
00:07:04,519 --> 00:07:05,240
Yue Wangshu,

130
00:07:05,480 --> 00:07:07,000
I've already agreed to investigate.

131
00:07:07,319 --> 00:07:08,199
What more do you want?

132
00:07:08,199 --> 00:07:09,319
My second accusation

133
00:07:09,319 --> 00:07:10,920
is also against Jiang Liuying.

134
00:07:11,720 --> 00:07:12,720
To avoid future threats,

135
00:07:13,399 --> 00:07:15,160
she used the Loong Lord sacrifice

136
00:07:16,319 --> 00:07:17,519
as an excuse for murder.

137
00:07:17,959 --> 00:07:18,879
Silence!

138
00:07:19,279 --> 00:07:21,399
Being sacrificed to the Loong Lord
was your honor.

139
00:07:21,800 --> 00:07:24,480
It was you who fled
and angered the Loong Lord.

140
00:07:24,879 --> 00:07:27,519
You've endangered
the people of all Daizhou!

141
00:07:27,519 --> 00:07:29,839
- That's right! Exactly!
- It's all your fault!

142
00:07:33,839 --> 00:07:34,600
You all claim

143
00:07:34,920 --> 00:07:36,959
my escape angered the Loong Lord.

144
00:07:37,480 --> 00:07:38,759
Yet I've been to the Loong Abyss.

145
00:07:39,120 --> 00:07:40,600
The Loong Lord told me himself

146
00:07:40,759 --> 00:07:42,759
that he requires no sacrificial bride,

147
00:07:43,399 --> 00:07:44,680
and he sent me back.

148
00:07:45,720 --> 00:07:46,759
Otherwise,

149
00:07:47,279 --> 00:07:48,360
how could a woman like me

150
00:07:48,639 --> 00:07:51,240
survive those raging currents unscathed?

151
00:07:51,240 --> 00:07:52,959
You planned it all along.

152
00:07:52,959 --> 00:07:55,199
You had an affair
and had someone take you away.

153
00:07:56,120 --> 00:07:57,079
You, Yue Wangshu,

154
00:07:57,399 --> 00:07:58,480
for your selfish desires,

155
00:07:58,480 --> 00:07:59,600
enraged the Loong Lord.

156
00:07:59,600 --> 00:08:01,439
Our family must rid the people of you.

157
00:08:01,680 --> 00:08:03,000
Enraged the Loong Lord?

158
00:08:03,800 --> 00:08:05,600
If the sacrifice was truly his will,

159
00:08:05,959 --> 00:08:07,720
why am I standing here safe and sound?

160
00:08:08,160 --> 00:08:09,680
Where is the Loong Lord's wrath?

161
00:08:09,680 --> 00:08:10,360
Instead,

162
00:08:10,959 --> 00:08:13,199
Yue Qiyang, who raised an army
to hunt me down,

163
00:08:13,680 --> 00:08:15,519
claimed to enforce heavenly justice

164
00:08:15,800 --> 00:08:18,000
but was struck by celestial fire
and burned severely.

165
00:08:18,000 --> 00:08:19,120
Even now, he lies bedridden,

166
00:08:19,120 --> 00:08:20,360
covered by festering wounds.

167
00:08:21,120 --> 00:08:21,920
Tell me, Madam Jiang,

168
00:08:22,480 --> 00:08:23,680
if it's not divine retribution,

169
00:08:24,879 --> 00:08:25,720
then what is it?

170
00:08:25,959 --> 00:08:26,600
You...

171
00:08:27,560 --> 00:08:28,560
Slanderous wretch!

172
00:08:28,959 --> 00:08:30,279
You must've worked with a sorcerer

173
00:08:30,279 --> 00:08:31,160
and used dark spells!

174
00:08:31,519 --> 00:08:33,480
How else could my brother's wounds
be so bizarre?

175
00:08:33,759 --> 00:08:35,720
I never claimed to possess such power.

176
00:08:36,399 --> 00:08:37,320
However, Madam Jiang,

177
00:08:37,320 --> 00:08:39,000
you claim to commune with deities

178
00:08:39,320 --> 00:08:40,720
and relay the Loong Lord's will.

179
00:08:41,279 --> 00:08:42,799
Why not set an altar at the Loong Abyss

180
00:08:42,799 --> 00:08:44,120
to accuse me there?

181
00:08:44,279 --> 00:08:46,279
Let the Loong Lord show his divine power

182
00:08:46,279 --> 00:08:47,120
and judge for himself

183
00:08:47,240 --> 00:08:48,440
whether the one beside me

184
00:08:48,679 --> 00:08:49,639
is a demon

185
00:08:50,279 --> 00:08:51,279
or a god.

186
00:08:58,320 --> 00:09:01,360
What a sharp tongue you have!

187
00:09:01,639 --> 00:09:04,279
You claim the Loong Lord protects you?

188
00:09:04,960 --> 00:09:08,399
Then mortal punishment
shouldn't harm you.

189
00:09:08,559 --> 00:09:10,200
If you can't endure the punishment,

190
00:09:10,519 --> 00:09:11,679
then by your own logic,

191
00:09:11,919 --> 00:09:13,840
you are spewing evil lies

192
00:09:14,159 --> 00:09:15,000
and deserve death!

193
00:09:17,360 --> 00:09:18,559
Yue Wangshu,

194
00:09:19,080 --> 00:09:20,240
do you dare?

195
00:09:21,120 --> 00:09:22,720
I have no objections.

196
00:09:23,360 --> 00:09:24,159
Good.

197
00:09:24,639 --> 00:09:26,320
Administer the punishment!

198
00:09:30,960 --> 00:09:31,960
Madam Jiang, you cannot!

199
00:09:37,960 --> 00:09:39,600
I must warn you all:

200
00:09:39,919 --> 00:09:40,879
Divine retribution is blind.

201
00:09:41,159 --> 00:09:41,960
Once caught in it,

202
00:09:42,480 --> 00:09:43,480
those who strike today

203
00:09:44,039 --> 00:09:44,879
or gave the order

204
00:09:45,519 --> 00:09:46,559
will all

205
00:09:47,000 --> 00:09:48,360
have no one to blame.

206
00:09:50,080 --> 00:09:52,399
The girl is only spouting nonsense!

207
00:09:53,240 --> 00:09:54,039
Yue Wangshu,

208
00:09:54,919 --> 00:09:56,080
let's see

209
00:09:56,320 --> 00:09:58,000
whether your resolve is tougher

210
00:09:58,159 --> 00:09:59,960
or the court's wooden paddles.

211
00:10:00,679 --> 00:10:01,440
Madam Jiang, hold on.

212
00:10:01,679 --> 00:10:03,000
If this enrages the Loong Lord,

213
00:10:03,320 --> 00:10:04,679
the consequences will be dire!

214
00:10:06,360 --> 00:10:07,320
Lord Zhang,

215
00:10:08,120 --> 00:10:10,679
would you side with a lying wretch

216
00:10:11,000 --> 00:10:12,960
against the safety of Daizhou?

217
00:10:13,120 --> 00:10:15,720
Or do you think my standing
carries less weight

218
00:10:16,039 --> 00:10:17,840
than an insolent brat?

219
00:10:31,028 --> 00:10:32,256
(Greed)

220
00:10:32,720 --> 00:10:33,960
It looks like the word "Greed".

221
00:10:33,960 --> 00:10:36,320
Lord Zhang amassed wealth
in the Loong Lord's name

222
00:10:36,919 --> 00:10:38,440
and was punished for it.

223
00:10:38,639 --> 00:10:39,679
So it's all true!

224
00:10:41,080 --> 00:10:42,080
It really is true!

225
00:10:42,240 --> 00:10:42,840
Right!

226
00:10:42,840 --> 00:10:44,039
Divine retribution is real!

227
00:10:51,240 --> 00:10:51,960
The god

228
00:10:51,960 --> 00:10:52,600
has manifested!

229
00:10:53,000 --> 00:10:53,639
Yue Wangshu,

230
00:10:54,000 --> 00:10:55,559
you wretch! You're behind this!

231
00:10:58,639 --> 00:10:59,720
You dare strike me?

232
00:10:59,720 --> 00:11:00,759
I'm saving your life.

233
00:11:01,600 --> 00:11:02,360
Harm me,

234
00:11:03,200 --> 00:11:04,879
and you'll end up just like Yue Qiyang.

235
00:11:05,039 --> 00:11:05,600
Yue Wangshu,

236
00:11:05,919 --> 00:11:06,720
you're seeking death!

237
00:11:07,159 --> 00:11:09,240
Seize this wretch! Get her!

238
00:11:09,360 --> 00:11:09,920
Stop!

239
00:11:16,115 --> 00:11:17,696
(Greed)

240
00:11:23,328 --> 00:11:29,248
♪If fate tears us apart♪

241
00:11:29,760 --> 00:11:35,392
♪I will gamble against heaven itself♪

242
00:11:35,712 --> 00:11:39,040
♪The loong's wrath
shakes mountains and rivers♪

243
00:11:39,040 --> 00:11:42,272
♪Calamity fire
burns away all evil spirits♪

244
00:11:42,592 --> 00:11:45,664
♪You are a drop of blood upon my heart♪

245
00:11:46,176 --> 00:11:49,856
♪I am a wound etched into your palm♪

246
00:11:49,856 --> 00:11:52,864
♪Cloud steps open,
where does the way home lie♪

247
00:11:53,088 --> 00:11:56,448
♪Scattering my divine soul
to gaze upon you for a lifetime♪

248
00:11:56,608 --> 00:11:59,328
♪Wind and snow bear witness,
this heart was not in vain♪

249
00:11:59,328 --> 00:12:00,032
(Greed)

250
00:12:05,960 --> 00:12:06,879
What's happening?

251
00:12:07,440 --> 00:12:08,120
- Spare us, Goddess!
- Spare us, Goddess!

252
00:12:08,240 --> 00:12:08,960
- Spare us, Goddess!
- Spare us, Goddess!

253
00:12:09,139 --> 00:12:10,432
How is this possible?

254
00:12:10,432 --> 00:12:11,424
- Right.
- What's going on?

255
00:12:11,680 --> 00:12:12,768
What was that?

256
00:12:16,120 --> 00:12:17,919
The General's Manor
sure flaunts its power.

257
00:12:18,360 --> 00:12:19,240
In broad daylight,

258
00:12:19,240 --> 00:12:20,120
before all eyes,

259
00:12:20,519 --> 00:12:22,039
how dare you defy this court

260
00:12:22,559 --> 00:12:24,519
and draw weapons with intent to kill!

261
00:12:25,000 --> 00:12:26,919
Guards, take these villains
into custody!

262
00:12:27,399 --> 00:12:29,159
Confine Madam Jiang
and her daughter at home.

263
00:12:29,960 --> 00:12:30,720
Without my order,

264
00:12:31,240 --> 00:12:32,039
neither shall leave!

265
00:12:33,759 --> 00:12:34,440
Let me go!

266
00:12:34,440 --> 00:12:35,120
Let me go!

267
00:12:35,600 --> 00:12:36,200
Let me go!

268
00:12:36,200 --> 00:12:37,000
Let go!

269
00:12:37,960 --> 00:12:39,200
Rest assured, Lady Wangshu.

270
00:12:39,399 --> 00:12:40,919
I will uncover the whole truth

271
00:12:41,159 --> 00:12:42,639
and bring justice to you sisters.

272
00:12:42,960 --> 00:12:43,840
Thank you, My Lord.

273
00:12:44,440 --> 00:12:45,639
I have one more request.

274
00:12:45,799 --> 00:12:46,360
Speak.

275
00:12:46,639 --> 00:12:49,080
I implore you to petition the court

276
00:12:49,399 --> 00:12:52,200
to ban Daizhou's century-old practice
of sacrificing to the Loong Lord.

277
00:13:05,960 --> 00:13:07,279
(Since you came out to help me,)

278
00:13:08,080 --> 00:13:09,519
(why do you still refuse to see me?)

279
00:13:18,559 --> 00:13:19,600
It's the Loong Lord!

280
00:13:20,879 --> 00:13:21,919
It's the Loong Lord!

281
00:13:22,440 --> 00:13:23,000
I grant

282
00:13:23,320 --> 00:13:24,120
your request.

283
00:13:26,159 --> 00:13:29,159
On behalf of all the people here,

284
00:13:29,799 --> 00:13:30,960
I thank you, Imperial Censor.

285
00:13:37,879 --> 00:13:38,679
And I thank

286
00:13:39,799 --> 00:13:40,639
the Loong Lord.

287
00:13:42,580 --> 00:13:43,136
(Justice for the People)

288
00:13:43,559 --> 00:13:45,639
- She's out!
- She's out!

289
00:13:47,879 --> 00:13:48,639
Lady Wangshu,

290
00:13:48,960 --> 00:13:49,679
if not for you,

291
00:13:49,679 --> 00:13:52,080
it would have been
my daughter's turn next year.

292
00:13:52,279 --> 00:13:52,919
Thank you!

293
00:13:53,679 --> 00:13:54,919
Thank you, Lady Wangshu!

294
00:13:54,919 --> 00:13:55,600
Thank you!

295
00:13:56,000 --> 00:13:57,320
Please get up.

296
00:13:57,320 --> 00:13:59,519
- Thank you, Lady Wangshu!
- Thank you!

297
00:14:00,200 --> 00:14:02,000
Thank you for saving my daughter!

298
00:14:02,879 --> 00:14:05,120
Thank you, Lady Wangshu!

299
00:14:06,639 --> 00:14:08,200
Please, Your Majesty...

300
00:14:15,759 --> 00:14:17,639
Sacrificing women to the Loong Lord

301
00:14:18,440 --> 00:14:20,639
and claiming
they were princesses titled by me.

302
00:14:24,120 --> 00:14:24,919
In my realm,

303
00:14:25,240 --> 00:14:26,960
such absurdity actually occurs?

304
00:14:29,600 --> 00:14:30,159
Tell me,

305
00:14:31,200 --> 00:14:31,799
how long?

306
00:14:32,159 --> 00:14:32,759
Your Majesty,

307
00:14:33,279 --> 00:14:34,279
this century-old custom

308
00:14:35,519 --> 00:14:36,559
is from the last dynasty.

309
00:14:38,000 --> 00:14:39,759
I was negligent and deserve death.

310
00:14:39,840 --> 00:14:40,759
You certainly do!

311
00:14:41,799 --> 00:14:43,320
A lady of the General's Manor

312
00:14:43,600 --> 00:14:46,039
dared draw a sword
to commit murder in open court.

313
00:14:46,399 --> 00:14:47,720
Without your shielding,

314
00:14:47,960 --> 00:14:49,600
she never would have been so brazen.

315
00:14:49,919 --> 00:14:50,960
My empire

316
00:14:51,799 --> 00:14:53,360
is being eaten away, bit by bit,

317
00:14:54,000 --> 00:14:55,759
by parasites like you.

318
00:14:56,480 --> 00:14:57,279
Please calm down.

319
00:14:57,399 --> 00:14:57,960
Please calm down.

320
00:14:58,200 --> 00:14:59,080
Hear my decree:

321
00:14:59,440 --> 00:15:00,360
This case

322
00:15:00,799 --> 00:15:02,159
goes to the Three Judicial Offices.

323
00:15:03,000 --> 00:15:04,200
Seal the General's Manor now.

324
00:15:04,559 --> 00:15:05,679
Confine the elder branch of Yue

325
00:15:05,679 --> 00:15:07,440
and the Jiang relatives
to their residences.

326
00:15:07,919 --> 00:15:09,240
None shall leave without my order.

327
00:15:09,268 --> 00:15:10,159
(Bright Mirror Suspended High)

328
00:15:10,159 --> 00:15:10,816
Yes.

329
00:15:23,799 --> 00:15:24,679
This red silk

330
00:15:27,360 --> 00:15:29,000
looks just like the bridal red that day.

331
00:15:31,360 --> 00:15:33,799
Wangshu, the matter is resolved for now.

332
00:15:34,639 --> 00:15:36,799
Why don't we write our names

333
00:15:37,320 --> 00:15:38,200
and hang them up?

334
00:15:38,919 --> 00:15:39,440
Sure.

335
00:15:40,039 --> 00:15:40,704
Let's go.

336
00:15:41,200 --> 00:15:43,000
Sir, two wooden plaques, please.

337
00:15:44,240 --> 00:15:45,159
Kind young ladies,

338
00:15:45,399 --> 00:15:47,039
you've done such a noble deed.

339
00:15:47,399 --> 00:15:48,399
For these wooden plaques,

340
00:15:48,559 --> 00:15:50,360
I couldn't possibly take your money.

341
00:15:50,360 --> 00:15:51,080
That won't do.

342
00:15:51,279 --> 00:15:53,080
Taking them without paying
makes us bullies.

343
00:15:53,399 --> 00:15:53,919
Take it.

344
00:15:54,279 --> 00:15:55,480
That young master with you,

345
00:15:55,480 --> 00:15:57,360
the one like a painting,

346
00:15:57,600 --> 00:15:58,519
already paid.

347
00:15:58,799 --> 00:15:59,440
Who

348
00:16:00,240 --> 00:16:00,759
do you mean?

349
00:16:02,740 --> 00:16:07,315
♪Bridal red blankets
ninety-nine miles of frost♪

350
00:16:08,090 --> 00:16:12,587
♪She looks back,
wind and rain veiling the moon♪

351
00:16:15,826 --> 00:16:20,948
♪Beneath the abyss, golden eyes open♪

352
00:16:20,948 --> 00:16:24,287
♪A thousand-year trial
scorches the soul♪

353
00:16:24,287 --> 00:16:25,651
♪Refusing to forget♪

354
00:16:29,317 --> 00:16:34,094
♪The mortal world's rules
are cruel and absurd♪

355
00:16:34,645 --> 00:16:36,435
♪He cannot learn them♪

356
00:16:36,435 --> 00:16:39,570
♪Yet carves her name upon his heart♪

357
00:16:42,722 --> 00:16:45,046
♪One name on a wooden plaque♪

358
00:16:45,046 --> 00:16:47,409
♪Swaying high upon the branch♪

359
00:16:47,987 --> 00:16:50,651
♪Waiting for snow and wind
to speak for him♪

360
00:16:50,651 --> 00:16:52,409
♪Their days ahead are long♪
